WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:24.395
Kip looked closely at his new friend.

2
00:00:24.396 --> 00:00:29.762
"You're right, Bird," he said.

3
00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:34.665
"This is a fake person.

4
00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:37.600
But she's still my friend."

5
00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:52.615
"No, she's our friend!" Bird said.

6
00:00:52.616 --> 00:01:10.439
Just then they heard a voice.

7
00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:14.882
"I lost Ashley!" cried a girl.

8
00:01:14.883 --> 00:01:17.528
"Don't worry," said her mom.

9
00:01:17.529 --> 00:01:19.794
"We'll find Ashley."

10
00:01:19.795 --> 00:01:24.336
"I wonder who Ashley is," said Bird.

11
00:01:24.337 --> 00:01:28.284
"It's sad that Ashley is lost," said Kip.

12
00:01:28.285 --> 00:01:31.374
"It sure is," said Bird.

13
00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:35.150
"I hope they find—"

14
00:01:35.151 --> 00:01:38.352
"Ashley!" cried the girl.

15
00:01:38.353 --> 00:01:43.443
The girl came running over.

16
00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:50.741
"She's going to take our friend!" cried Kip.

17
00:01:50.742 --> 00:01:55.349
"Kip, wait!" said Bird.

18
00:01:55.350 --> 00:02:07.026
"I found Ashley, Mom!" called the girl.

19
00:02:07.027 --> 00:02:15.542
"The fake person is Ashley!" said Bird.

20
00:02:15.543 --> 00:02:18.688
"Oh well," said Kip.

21
00:02:18.689 --> 00:02:26.864
"It's sad that we lost our fake friend."

22
00:02:26.865 --> 00:02:37.574
"I like real friends better anyway," said Bird.

23
00:02:37.575 --> 00:02:40.036
"Me too," said Kip.

24
00:02:40.037 --> 00:02:49.148
"Let's play hide-and-seek!"
